 JSON in, JSON out. Routes are listed in `README.md`.

+## Access and routes
+
+Send `Authorization: Bearer <key>` on every request. A viewer can use GET
+routes except `/audit`. A cook can also POST to `/recipes/:id/cook`,
+`/batches/:id/waste`, `/temperatures`, and `/stocktakes/:id/counts`.
+A manager can use every route. `GET /audit` returns successful data-changing
+requests newest first, with time, key name, method, path and status. See
+`README.md` for the complete route list. Missing or unknown keys return 401
+(`unauthorized`); insufficient permission returns 403 (`forbidden`).
+
 ## Errors

 Errors have a status from `src/errors.js` and the body
