 - Fridges must read at or below 5 °C and freezers at or below -15 °C. Each
   of them needs at least one reading per day.
 - Allergens are the 14 EU allergens, stored lowercase and sorted.
+
+## API access and audit (schema 3)
+
+- `apiKeys` holds objects with `key`, `name`, and `role` (`viewer`, `cook`,
+  or `manager`). Migrated files start with no keys; provision keys before
+  serving the API. Keep keys secret and replace the example seed keys.
+- `audit` holds successful data-changing HTTP requests in insertion order.
+  Each entry records `time` (an ISO instant), `keyName`, `method`, `path`
+  (without query string), and response `status`.
